# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# LineageOS lets system_server read the vendor security patch level, so the
# SecurityStateManager hands it to every application. Applications compare that
# value with their own read of ro.vendor.build.security_patch, which the
# platform policy otherwise denies them, so the property reads as empty to the
# application and the two disagree. The value is public configuration that the
# API already reports.
get_prop(appdomain, vendor_security_patch_level_prop)
